    "pocketstation::recording::error_code::RecordingErrorCode::InvalidStemLabel: Reports that the supplied stem label is invalid.",
    "pocketstation::recording::error_code::RecordingErrorCode::DuplicateStemLabel: Reports that stem label duplicates an existing declaration or record.",
    "pocketstation::recording::error_code::RecordingErrorCode::SessionMismatch: Reports that session does not match the expected contract.",
    "pocketstation::recording::error_code::RecordingErrorCode::PermissionDenied: Reports that the required permission was denied.",
    "pocketstation::recording::error_code::RecordingErrorCode::InvalidSampleSpec: Reports that the supplied sample spec is invalid.",
    "pocketstation::recording::error_code::RecordingErrorCode::SourceMismatch: Reports that source does not match the expected contract.",
    "pocketstation::recording::error_code::RecordingErrorCode::LineageMismatch: Reports that lineage does not match the expected contract.",
    "pocketstation::recording::error_code::RecordingErrorCode::FrameSpecMismatch: Reports that frame spec does not match the expected contract.",
    "pocketstation::recording::error_code::RecordingErrorCode::UnalignedSamples: Reports that samples does not align to complete frames or channels.",
    "pocketstation::recording::error_code::RecordingErrorCode::TimestampOutOfRange: Reports that timestamp falls outside the supported range.",
    "pocketstation::recording::error_code::RecordingErrorCode::GapTooLarge: Reports that gap exceeds the supported size limit.",
